<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  SYNTHETIC test dictionary. Not a venue dictionary and not venue-certified.

  A FIX 4.4 subset with the standard session messages, an ExecutionReport with nested and
  sibling repeating groups and a length-prefixed data field, and venue-defined custom fields
  (5001-5003) and a custom message type (U1). It demonstrates that a dialect is configured
  through its dictionary and column mapping, not through connector code.
-->
